     "last_code": "od = [12, 8, 15, 6, 10, 14, 9, 11]\ncommit = 10.0\nrate = 0.72\ntotal=0\nfor c in od:\n    d=c*rate\n    if d<=commit: total+=commit\n    else:\n        # uncovered usage billed at full OD = (d-commit)/rate * 1.0, but note d-commit is in $ at rate\n        # usage units = (d-commit)/rate; billed at OD 1.0/unit => (d-commit)/rate\n        # But simpler: total = commit + (c - commit/rate)  [since c at OD for the excess usage]\n        total += commit + (c - commit/rate)\nprint(round(total,2), round(sum(od)-total,2))\n",
